# Auto-test input sequence for INKBOUND.
# Format: <time_seconds> <op> [keys...]
#   op = hold   -> press keys and keep them held
#        release-> release keys ("release all" releases everything)
#        tap    -> press now, auto-release ~0.1s later (good for jumps)
#        clear  -> release everything
#   keys: a-z, 0-9, left/right/up/down, space, shift, ctrl, alt, ...
#   '#' starts a comment; blank lines are ignored.
#
# Play it with:  engine.play_input_sequence {"file":"<path to this>.seq"}
#            or:  engine.play_input_sequence {"text":"0 hold d\n2 clear"}

0.0   hold d          # start running right
1.0   tap space       # jump
2.3   tap space       # jump again
3.2   clear           # stop (release everything)
